---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Research Outputs">
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Research Outputs</h1>
      <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Research</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="content">
    <div class="container">
      <p>
        The SCAN II project produces comprehensive research on the enforcement of EU civil procedures
        across Member States. Our research outputs include comparative studies, national reports, and
        best practice guidelines.
      </p>

      <h2>Comparative Study</h2>
      <p>
        The "Comparative and Analytical Study of Best Practices" examines enforcement procedures for
        ESCP and EOP judgments across all EU Member States, identifying best practices and areas for
        improvement.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a href="/practices-guides" class="btn">View Comparative Study</a>
      </p>

      <h2>National Reports</h2>
      <p>
        Detailed reports on enforcement procedures in each EU Member State, covering:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Status of digitalization of ESCP enforcement procedures</li>
        <li>Status of digitalization of EOP enforcement procedures</li>
        <li>General information on national enforcement systems</li>
        <li>Competent authorities and their roles</li>
        <li>Costs and timelines</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Publications</h2>
      <p>
        Academic publications and policy papers produced by the project consortium members.
      </p>

      <h2>Access the Platform</h2>
      <p>
        For detailed information on enforcement procedures in each Member State, visit our SCAN2 Platform.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a href="/scan2-platform" class="btn">Access SCAN2 Platform</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
